// PAS-DEBT-B2-010c Slice C (#1542, v0.36.66) — repetition fixture.
//
// `$( ... )*` repetition on both pattern and template sides.
// Under Slice C, `list(1, 2, 3)` matches the `$( $x:expr ),*`
// pattern with `$x` bound to the iteration list `[1, 2, 3]`, and
// the template `[ $($x),* ]` emits `[ 1,2,3 ]`.
//
// End-to-end code-emission coverage waits on the macro-driver work
// (PAS-DEBT-B7-001, #1529) that wires expand_macro into the pass
// pipeline; this fixture documents the intended parser + expander
// round trip today.

module M = structure {
  macro list($($x:expr),*) => { [ $($x),* ] }
}
